"OLAYLAR_ARKEOLOJI_ZINCIR:-2299-01-01:0":{"b": ["乌玛、乌尔：无主间隔→阿卡德帝国", "25980168"], "d": ["乌玛、乌尔各点的所有权由无主间隔转为阿卡德帝国。来源转换信息：萨尔贡击败卢伽尔扎吉西；阿卡德的统治始于巴比伦尼亚南部（表39：“Sargonic period beginning in Babylonia” 约公元前2300年，MC；MC II 约公元前2292年）| 来源：Sallaberger, W. & Schrakamp, I. (eds.) 2015, ARCANE III: History & Philology, Brepols (Kisim I; 中年代学=MC)，第90页；表39，第136页 | http://www.assyriologie.uni-muenchen.de/personen/professoren/sallaberger/publ_sallaberger/wasa_schrakamp_2015_arcane1.pdf | «he defeated Lugalzagesi of Uruk and thus became the only king of ", "c017226e"]},
